WEBVTT

10:07.633 --> 10:09.260
That little bundle.

10:11.220 --> 10:13.472
They took him away
and I never saw him again.

10:13.598 --> 10:15.933
Never have visited the crypt, never.

10:26.819 --> 10:28.571
I pray to the Mother
every morning and night

10:28.696 --> 10:30.823
that she return your child to you.
